Verse 1:
[Ab]I’m pressing on the upward [Db]way,
New heights I’m [Ab]gaining every [Eb]day;
[Eb7]Still praying [Ab]as I’m onward [Db]bound,
“Lord, plant my [Ab]feet on [Eb7]higher [Ab]ground.”
